WEBVTT

00:04:00.746 --> 00:04:03.288
We went into this wanting to understand

00:04:03.288 --> 00:04:06.538
whether trust was playing
any role whatsoever

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:10.663
in these failed ecosystems' inability
to scale and grow

00:04:10.704 --> 00:04:13.371
in comparison to their successful peers.

00:04:13.788 --> 00:04:18.163
For instance, we studied Orkut
versus Facebook.

00:04:18.496 --> 00:04:19.746
What is that?

00:04:19.746 --> 00:04:21.704
You don't know what Orkut is?

00:04:22.288 --> 00:04:24.121
Why doesn't that surprise me?

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:28.121
RIM / Blackberry
versus Apple iOS or Android,

00:04:28.121 --> 00:04:30.538
HouseTrip versus Airbnb.